          "documentation": "status = confirmed / cancelled / fulfilled / expired. startsAt < endsAt. Quantity is the number of distinct ReservationItems. Recheck availability atomically on commit. No overlapping active reservations for the same Equipment; intervals are half-open [start,end). Cannot cancel once any related equipment has been borrowed. Optional project must be accessible.",
