          },
          "name": "Notification",
          "documentation": "kind = overdue / incident. Exactly one subject: LoanItem for overdue or EquipmentIssue for incident. Overdue requires ReminderPolicy; recipient is borrower. Incident recipients are authorised administrators. Unique deduplicationKey per subject, recipient and reminder slot. status = queued / sent / failed / skipped. Recheck returnedAt and dueAt immediately before sending; retries reuse the notification.",
